<title>SWITZERLAND: Swiss launch six-month money market claims.</title>
<headline>Swiss launch six-month money market claims.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1997-03-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Swiss federal government is issuing six-month money market claims to be paid for on March 13, the Swiss National Bank said.</p>
<p>The allocation follows the end of subscriptions on March 11.</p>
<p>The previous issue of three-month claims, paid for on February 6, raised 805.8 million francs and was priced at 99.617 percent to yield 1.521 percent annually.</p>
<p>-- Zurich Editorial, +41 1 258 7340</p>
